OL,3,GNEWSATwelve arrested in connection with
OL,4,AMiddlesbrough crash that killed two
OL,5,Apolice officers
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of five people involved in a crash
OL,8,Fnear Middlesborough on Saturday
OL,9,Fpreviously pleaded guilty to assaulting
OL,10,Fa police officer
OL,12,FCourt records show 18-year-old Makai
OL,13,FSaddington appeared before Teesside
OL,14,FMagistrates in July
OL,16,FOver the weekend, two police officers
OL,17,Fwere killed when a car travelling the
OL,18,Fwrong way on the A66 collided with
OL,19,Ftheir marked vehicle. The five people
OL,20,Fin the Volkswagen Passat were also
OL,21,Fkilled
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
