OL,3,GNEWSATwelve arrested in connection with
OL,4,AMiddlesbrough crash that killed two
OL,5,Apolice officers
OL,6,
OL,7,FPC Tom Clough, 38, has been remembered
OL,8,Fby colleagues as "fun-loving" while a
OL,9,Fcollege PC Matthew Blades, 37, once
OL,10,Fworked at said he was "intelligent" and
OL,11,F"kind"
OL,13,FThe five in the Passat have been named
OL,14,Fas Michael Robert Cahill, 23, Theo Rae,
OL,15,F17, Cole Robert Worthy, 17, Jakub
OL,16,FMatusiak, 23, and 18-year-old
OL,17,FSaddington
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
